    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40812" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rĕflexĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		id.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A bending</i> or <i>turning back</i>,
				<i>reflection</i> (post-class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cervicis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Macr. S. 5, 11</span></i>
			. — </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>the conversion of a
				proposition</i>, <i><span class="en">App. Dogm. Plat. 3, p.
				33, 34</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Mart. Cap. 4, §
				412</span></i>.</div>
